      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitaker%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Whitaker was incorporated on January 4, 1904, from part of former Mifflin Township.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitaker%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Whitaker sits on the Monongahela River, just 3 miles upriver from Pittsburgh.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitaker%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Whitaker borders Munhall to the northwest and West Mifflin to the south and east.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
