      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitaker%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Across the Monongahela River lie Braddock and Rankin, the latter linked by Rankin Bridge.",
